+++ b/HEY_MIMI_PRO_V17_MAPS_FIX.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Hey Mimi Pro v17 — Google Maps / navigation repair (build 318)
+
+- Keeps Pro v16 media/AI/PiP commands.
+- Uses Maps before Waze in Auto navigation preference. Explicit Waze preference remains respected.
+- Handles compound `Mimi mở Google Maps dẫn đường đến ...` without losing destination.
+- Detects `mở Maps trên màn hình xe` and avoids routing it to TikTok or YouTube search.
+- Uses Maps launcher or geo intent as fallback, and checks installed package independently of launcher activity.
+- **Android Auto limitation**: T-Tube's active projection uses `CarActivityService`, **not** an AndroidX `CarContext` session. It cannot force another app to foreground on the car. Only `CarContext.startCarApp(ACTION_NAVIGATE)` can request car-side nav when a legitimate active `CarContext` is available. A phone intent is not confirmation of car-side screen switching.
+- For direct Maps display on car, user may need to select Maps on the Android Auto launcher while T-Tube submits location on the phone.
+- Test with car parked; keep navigation controls available in standard AA launcher.
